  {"type": "text", "id": "card_b", "x": 100, "y": 610, "text": "\"basically we are going to use Gemini to come up\n with prompts and then the gen media to create\n the content for the prompts\"\n\nGemini → prompts   Imagen · Veo · Lyria → media", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 3, "strokeColor": "#ccfbf1"},
